      <br><br>
      <p>
        <b>Genome alignments</b><br>
        Insertions have been aligned to all assembly versions of the representative maize 
        genome B73, and to the W22 genome assembly v2 (Zm-W22-REFERENCE-NRGENE-2.0\).
        <br><br>
        An insertion is considered to be associated with a gene model if it aligns within
        10kb upstream or downstream, or within a gene model UTR, exon, or intron. All 
        transcripts are considered, not just the canonical transcript.
      </p>
      <br><br>
      <p><strong>The UniformMu Resource in Detail</strong></p>
      <p>
        <ol type="I" class="uniformmu">
          <li class="uniformmu">
            <a href="#I"><strong>Key features and current status of the  UniformMu resource</strong></a>
          </li>
